ttps://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>","text":"I had the pleasure of joining the Sickboy Podcast. I describe how I became a psychiatrist and Neuromodulation doctor from being a special education student and subsequently recording engineer.\n\nIt’s quite the origin story and frank conversation about how and why I do the work that I do. Depression and OCD can be in remission in as soon as 5 days with accelerated treatment using TMS like SAINT (MDD) or BRAIN (OCD). This approach has independent validation for cost saving and better outcomes in health care.\n\nSubscribe now"}